Description: 'ransomtriage: offline ransomware family identification, IOC extraction and decryptor lookup'
Category: Ransomware
Author: Douglas Weant
Version: 1.0
Id: af95a288-9be4-4070-8201-895efd5985ed
BinaryUrl: https://github.com/redhat1032/ransomware-triage/releases/download/v0.3.0/ransomtriage.pyz
ExportFormat: json
Processors:
    -
        Executable: C:\Windows\System32\cmd.exe
        CommandLine: /c python "%kapeDirectory%\Modules\bin\ransomtriage.pyz" scan %sourceDirectory% --format json --no-entropy --output "%destinationDirectory%\ransomtriage.json"
        ExportFormat: json
    -
        Executable: C:\Windows\System32\cmd.exe
        CommandLine: /c python "%kapeDirectory%\Modules\bin\ransomtriage.pyz" scan %sourceDirectory% --format markdown --no-entropy --output "%destinationDirectory%\ransomtriage.md"
        ExportFormat: md

# Documentation
# https://github.com/redhat1032/ransomware-triage
# Requires Python 3.9+ on PATH. Place ransomtriage.pyz (from the GitHub release) in KAPE\Modules\bin\.
